# Additive schema diff — delivery scheduling (proposed, post-review)

## DeliveryStatus enum
+ SCHEDULED
+ SUPERSEDED

## Delivery model
+ plannedDeliveryAt    DateTime?
+ receivedAt           DateTime?
+ rescheduleReason     String?
+ supersedesDeliveryId String?
+ relation supersedes / supersededBy ("DeliveryReschedule")
  via composite FK (supersedesDeliveryId, purchaseOrderId) → (id, purchaseOrderId)
+ @@unique([id, purchaseOrderId])
+ @@index([companyId, status, plannedDeliveryAt])
+ @@index([supplierId, status, plannedDeliveryAt])
+ @@index([supersedesDeliveryId])

## DB constraints (SQL)
+ Delivery_supersedes_same_po_fkey (same purchase order)
+ Delivery_supersedes_not_self_check
+ (optional step 2) Delivery_scheduled_requires_planned_date_check
+ (optional step 2) Delivery_reschedule_requires_reason_check

## Unchanged
- PurchaseOrder, OrderItem (including quantityVerifiedReceived, unitPrice, originalExpectedDeliveryAt)
- DeliveryItem.quantityDelivered (planned qty for SCHEDULED; claimed qty for legacy SUBMITTED)
- Grn / GrnItem (immutable, 1:1 with Delivery)
- StaffPermissionCode VERIFY_DELIVERY / ISSUE_GRN
- Existing Delivery/GRN row values (migration is additive DDL only)
